good evening ladies and gentlemen I'm  Cheryl Boone Isaacs president of the  Academy and it is my pleasure to welcome  you to the 42nd student Academy Awards  as that wonderful video attests tonight  we are honoring an amazing range of  filmmakers and future Academy members  the student Academy Awards were created  in 1972 as an extension of the Academy's  mission to engage emerging filmmakers  support New Voices and celebrate the  excellent work that is being done by  young filmmakers and tonight it's truly  an international group I'm pleased to  report than in the last few years the  student Academy Awards has come into its  own as one of the world's most exciting  competitions for young filmmakers this  year for the first time submissions were  done online and the number of film  submissions has more than tripled this  year we saw 1686 submissions  representing 282 schools in the US and  many more schools overseas these films  were judged in five categories animation  documentary narrative alternative and  foreign more Academy members than ever  before served as judges this year and  I'd like to thank those members who for  the first time were able to view our  submissions and participate as judges  from as far away as Ireland India China  Italy the UK and Australia your support  of this program as well as other  educational initiatives all serve the  vital purpose of helping us to cultivate  the next generation of filmmakers who  represent the future of our industry and  of our Academy  we could not keep up these wonderful  Academy traditions without your long  hours of dedication  I want to express my heartfelt  congratulations to our student winners  you've joined an elite group of  filmmakers whose ranks include Robert  Zemeckis John Lasseter Pete docter  Trey Parker and Spike Lee along with  many others celebrated filmmakers who  have gone on after winning student  Academy Awards to earn 46 Oscar  nominations and have won or shared eight  Oscars I hope for each of you your  student academy award is the first step  in a very long and successful career I  can speak for all of us at the academy  when I say we can't wait to see what  lies ahead for you now I would like to  introduce our first presenter Michelle  Rodriguez
 

